# Attach Menu

::summary
The composer ＋ menu (RULED 08-05) — a small ANCHORED menu, not a centered sheet: `dropdown-select` is its vocabulary. Three items: Document and Task open the doc/task attach picker (`modals/doc-task-picker.surf`) in the matching mode; Photo opens the media picker (`modals/media-picker.surf`), Surfspace image library first.
::

::dropdown-select[name=attach-menu placement=anchored anchor=composer-attach action=runAttachAction]
- "Document" value=document icon=doc description="Attach a workspace doc to the thread" action=openDocPicker
- "Task" value=task icon=task description="Attach a workspace task" action=openTaskPicker
- "Photo" value=photo icon=file description="Surfspace image library first" action=openMediaPicker
::

Anchored to the thread composer's ＋; scrim-click and Esc dismiss (an anchored menu carries no ✕ — it is not a sheet). The same menu serves every thread composer; Posts compose reaches media directly through its Add media slot.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the anchored menu goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide anchoring is unchanged.
